Costco reported diluted earnings per share of $18.21 for fiscal 2025, the 52-week year ended August 31, 2025. Net income rose 10% to $8,099, or $18.21 per diluted share, compared with $7,367, or $16.56 per diluted share, in 2024. [1] The filing also notes that foreign-exchange rates reduced net income by $97, or $0.22 per diluted share. [1]